<title>INDIA: India Century Laminating Co to meet for bonus.</title>
<headline>India Century Laminating Co to meet for bonus.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Century Laminating Company Ltd will meet on March 25 to consider an equity share bonus issue, the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>No other details were given.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
